  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA distributed value fell 6.3% over 30D:</strong> On-chain RWA distributed value at $13.97B (6.3% lower over 30D). Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/ecosystems/2026-11-12-securitize-ethena-buidl-liquidity-facility-live-usdc-438442\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Securitize and Ethena\u2019s $100 million BlackRock BUIDL liquidity facility goes live</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/tradfi-and-fintech/anthropic-retracts-ipo-range-as-crypto-products-await-debut\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Anthropic Retracts IPO Range as Crypto Products Await Debut</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Institutional commitments are still a leading share signal:</strong> Bank and asset-manager distribution deals often shift platform and network leadership before headline RWA totals fully catch up. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-11-12-bitgo-expands-institutional-stablecoin-minting-and-redemption-platform-with-usdc-438525\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BitGo expands institutional stablecoin minting and redemption platform with USDC</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/dtcc-plans-solana-expansion-wallet-rules-limit-access?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DTCC Plans Solana Expansion as Wallet Rules Limit Access</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
